=begin
  libeo: the shared library for the e-scripts.

  Loaded once per session with Script.loadlib('libeo'); definitions persist after the
  library script exits. Script.loadlib never loads it twice, so a script that needs a newer
  copy than the session holds runs libeo again. Then it names the version it was built
  against and the library refuses a mismatch loudly:

    Script.loadlib('libeo')
    Script.run('libeo') if Gem::Version.new(::EO::VERSION) < Gem::Version.new('0.22.0')
    EO.require('0.22.0')

  This file only loads the library. The library itself is scripts/eo/, one file per
  concern; each file opens with what it holds, and README.md has the list.

        author: elanthia-online
  contributors: Nisugi
          game: Gemstone
          tags: library, utility, eo
      required: Lich >= 5.22.0
       version: 0.22.0

  Version Control:
  Major_change.feature_addition.bugfix
  v0.22.0 (2026-11-13)
    - Stance changes are Lich's (Lich::Gemstone::Stance.change): EO::Cleanse::Wounds.stance
      and STANCES are gone
  v0.21.0 (2026-11-13)
    - Mana pulses are Lich's (Lich::Gemstone::Mana.pulse): it waits out roundtime first
      and reads only an answer that starts its line. EO::Cleanse.mana_pulse and the two
      MANA_PULSE patterns are gone, and EO::Guild::Forage.ready no longer takes a pulse
  v0.20.0 (2026-11-13)
    - EO::Wander, from ewander 2.0.1: a creature by name (find_target, hostile?,
      target_npc!), the rooms visited (wander_rooms), and one step (wander!,
      wander_standard!, wander_gsiv_confluence!, wander_other_confluence!,
      track_confluence_landmarks!)
  v0.19.0 (2026-11-13)
    - EO::Guild::Disablers, from echild 1.20.4: the disabling spells (table), being able
      to cast (can_cast?), whether there is justice (justice?), the spell for what is
      in the room (best), TARGET RANDOM (target_random) and the cast (cast)
    - EO::Guild::Rescue, from echild 1.20.4: the child (child, await_child, here), where
      it lives and the guards' rooms (ask_home, homes, dropoffs), a room that is a
      danger to it (threat?), waiting for it (await), who to report to (reportee), and
      the roots of the Maaghara Labyrinth (maaghara_exits, climb_root)
  v0.18.0 (2026-11-13)
    - EO::Guild::Escort, from escortgo2 1.0.5: the task and its towns (task, PICKUPS,
      DROPOFFS, TRAVEL_COST), having the client follow (follow), the nearest of a list
      of rooms (nearest), being hurt (hurt?), the ambush watch (ambush_watch), and the
      walk (Walk: hide, haste, protect, check_room, escort_here?, find_path, step,
      backtrack) with its routes for the hard parts of the roads (ROUTES)
  v0.17.0 (2026-11-13)
    - EO::Guild::Forage, from ebounty 1.13.0: the rooms a herb grows in (rooms), the herbs
      held (held), what FORAGE wants it called (linked_item), the spells and readying
