      (hurt?), leaving a room (leave, stop_song), and handing herbs over (give)
    - EO::Guild::Heirloom, from ebounty 1.13.0: the spells before a search (spells), the
      search and what it turns up (search), and the step to the next room (wander)
  v0.16.0 (2026-11-13)
    - EO::Guild::Completion, from ebounty 1.13.0: the rule a hunting script stops on, as
