    - EO::Items, from eloot 2.15.0: MARK's unsellable (marked?), throwing an item away
      (toss), phasing a box and bringing it back (phase, unphase), lifting a curse by 315
      or an eonake gauntlet (lift_curse), waiting for the disk (await_disk)
    - EO::Boxes, from eloot 2.15.0: opening a box, looking in, taking coins once and the
      answers to it, and which emptied box is kept (keep?)
  v0.3.0 (2026-11-13)
    - EO::Containers, from eloot 2.15.0: the OPEN, LOOK IN and CLOSE answers, whether
      Lich has a container's contents (listed?), opening one that does not (ensure_open),
      waiting for contents (contents_ready?), reading them fresh (fresh_contents), close
    - EO::Hands, from eloot 2.15.0: the GET and PUT answers, what the hands hold
      (holding?), freeing one (free_hand), taking an item (take), wearing one (wear),
